    "description": "San Francisco - Forest Knolls - House for rent\nRemodeled ocean view single family home with a 2 car garage\nLink to mobile layout: \u00a0 http://www.jwavro.com/rental_details.php?id=33014344-0\nSummary:\nRent: $9950\nBed / Bath: 4 / 3\nType: House\nTerm: 1 Year\nPlease contact:\nOren Bordo \u00a0 |\nshow contact info\n| \u00a0 \u00a0 www.jwavro.com\nDescription:\nLive in this recently remodeled single family home with Ocean and Bay views!\nBeautiful kitchen with stainless steel appliances - gas stove, refrigerator, dishwasher and disposal.\nBreakfast bar with room for stools.\nSpacious living room and separate dining area with large windows facing the ocean. Very bright!\nFireplace in the living room.\n3 bedrooms on the main level including a master suite with private bathroom and a 2nd bathroom in the hall.\n1 bedroom on the lower level with a private bathroom (2nd master suite)\nHuge family room that leads out to the patio.\n2 car garage parking with plenty of storage space.\nWasher and dryer provided in the garage.\nDouble paned windows throughout.\nAll wood floors. Recessed lighting.\n1 small potty-trained pet will be considered.\nNear charming W. Portal village, the Inner Sunset and UCSF.\nApproximately 2000sf.\nSchools nearby like Grattan Elementary, Clarendon Elementary and Ruth Asawa School of the Arts to name a few.\nThis is a non-smoking unit.\nDetails:\nFloors: Hardwood\nKitchen: Remodeled\nLaundry: In Unit\nOutside area: Patio\nParking: 2 Car Garage\nParking Fee: $0\nPets:   One small dog or cat considered    OK\nView: Bay & Ocean\nLocation:\nLake Forest Court & Oak Park Drive, San Francisco, California\nMeet the J.Wavro Team:\nhttp://www.jwavro.com/us.php\nPlease contact:\nOren Bordo \u00a0 |\nshow contact info\n| \u00a0 \u00a0 www.jwavro.com\nPreview more properties at www.jwavro.com\nThis unit is a rental unit subject to the San Francisco Rent Ordinance, which limits evictions without just cause, and which states that any waiver by a tenant of their rights under the Rent Ordinance is void as contrary to public policy.\nContent and Images \u00a9 2003 - 2023 J.Wavro \u00a0 | \u00a0 BRE # 01810008 \u00a0 | \u00a0 cl31401492014934-0",
